{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1000000000000000","type":"group","x":0,"y":-420,"width":2560,"height":320,"color":"5","label":"0. Domain SSOT & The Curriculum (الدوري)"},
		{"id":"1000000000000001","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":540,"height":920,"color":"5","label":"1. Upstream Prep & Active Queues"},
		{"id":"1000000000000002","type":"group","x":620,"y":0,"width":700,"height":920,"color":"6","label":"2. Core Processing (/tafreegh Skill)"},
		{"id":"1000000000000003","type":"group","x":1400,"y":0,"width":540,"height":920,"color":"4","label":"3. Export, Delivery & QA Gate"},
		{"id":"1000000000000004","type":"group","x":2020,"y":0,"width":540,"height":920,"color":"2","label":"4. Human Review & Continuous Learning (Diff Loop)"},
		{"id":"1000000000000005","type":"group","x":0,"y":1040,"width":2560,"height":1000,"color":"3","label":"5. Engineering Governance, Tests & Guardrails"},
		{"id":"1000000000000006","type":"group","x":25,"y":1360,"width":2510,"height":650,"color":"3","label":"Architecture Decision Records (docs/adr/0001-0009)"},
		{"id":"2000000000000001","type":"text","x":40,"y":-370,"width":520,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"### Project Identity & Mission\n**Tafreegh** (تفريغ الدروس الشرعية): Scholarly transcription & canonical alignment pipeline for **The Curriculum** (الدوري), delivered by **Sheikh Osama** (فضيلة الشيخ أسامة).\n\n- **Core Principle**: **Blind Literalism** — exact vowelized Matn from canonical texts + verbatim Egyptian colloquial explanation.\n- **Obsidian Skill Junction**: `tafreegh-skill/` (non-dot root junction) -> `.agents/skills/tafreegh/` (`C:\\Users\\L\\.agents\\skills\\tafreegh`)."},
		{"id":"2000000000000002","type":"file","x":600,"y":-370,"width":420,"height":240,"file":"tafreegh-skill/references/course-routing.md"},
		{"id":"2000000000000003","type":"text","x":1060,"y":-370,"width":580,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"### Dynamic Course Routing Map (course-routing.md)\nParsed dynamically at runtime by `workspace_catalog.py` (`RuleCatalog.load()`):\n- `زاد` (زاد المعاد) | `صيد` (صيد الخاطر) | `رياض` (رياض الصالحين)\n- `سيرة` / `رحيق` (الرحيق المختوم) | `ديوان` (ديوان الشافعي)\n- `توحيد` / `فتح` (فتح الباري - كتاب التوحيد) | `روضة` (شرح مختصر الروضة)\n- `أصول` / `لب` (لب الأصول) | `معاملات` / `دليل` (دليل الطالب - كتاب البيع)\n- `بيوع` / `خثلان` (فقه البيوع - سعد الخثلان) | `أسماء` | `منطق` / `سلم` (السلم المنورق)\n- Supports `YYYY-MM-DD` date stems & mirrored **Numbered Lecture Stems** (`[N]-[subject]_[N]`)."},
		{"id":"2000000000000004","type":"file","x":1680,"y":-370,"width":420,"height":240,"file":"GLOSSARY.md"},
		{"id":"2000000000000005","type":"file","x":2140,"y":-370,"width":380,"height":240,"file":"docs/Tafreegh-Overview.md"},
		{"id":"2100000000000001","type":"text","x":30,"y":50,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"5","text":"### Upstream Prep (NotebookLM / Gemini Notebook)\n- Transcribe lecture audio exclusively via **Gemini Notebook** into raw `.md` drafts.\n- Extract per-lecture canonical book pages into vowelized **Matn Source** `.md` files with exact *tashkeel* & Mushaf orthography."},
		{"id":"2100000000000002","type":"text","x":30,"y":260,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### 02_Raw_Inputs/ (Raw Draft Queue)\n- Holds incoming unedited **Gemini Notebook** transcripts awaiting `/tafreegh`.\n- Stem-matched inputs archive atomically into `02_Raw_Inputs/processed/` after verified `.docx` export (ADR 0002)."},
		{"id":"2100000000000003","type":"text","x":30,"y":460,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"### 01_Matn_Sources/ (Canonical Matn Queue)\n- Holds per-lecture vowelized **Matn Source** files — absolute authority for **Blind Literalism**.\n- Consumed sources archive atomically into `01_Matn_Sources/processed/` alongside raw inputs."},
		{"id":"2100000000000004","type":"text","x":30,"y":660,"width":480,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"### Long-Transcript Chunking (`chunk_transcript.py`)\n- `tafreegh-skill/scripts/chunk_transcript.py` (mirrored at `scripts/chunk_transcript.py`).\n- Splits long transcripts into `1,000-1,600`-word chunks (`target: 1,300`) at Arabic punctuation or `طالب:` turn boundaries.\n- Stores chunks in temporary `_مقاطع/` subfolders, automatically deleted during atomic archiving."},
		{"id":"2200000000000001","type":"file","x":650,"y":50,"width":640,"height":180,"file":"tafreegh-skill/SKILL.md"},
		{"id":"2200000000000002","type":"text","x":650,"y":260,"width":640,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"### Matn Alignment & 3 Matching Modes (`matn_matcher.py`)\n- **Primary Mode**: **Sequential Cursor** (`2,000`-char forward + `0 -> cursor` look-behind), exact *tashkeel* copy, **Anchor Expiry** (`>= 500` words / `~2,500` chars).\n- **Dynamic Fallback Interleaving**: Per-segment switch on incomplete sources (`<!-- fallback -->`), **Sandwiched Context** (**Conservative Doubt**), **Compound Sharh-Matn** (بقوله، / في قوله، / قوله:), **Seam Repetition**, + تقرير المتن الهجين.\n- **Fallback Mode**: Verbal triggers (قال، قال المصنف، فصل في) + 100% Classical Arabic fingerprint (plain orthography)."},
		{"id":"2200000000000003","type":"file","x":650,"y":510,"width":305,"height":170,"file":"tafreegh-skill/references/dialect-rules.md"},
		{"id":"2200000000000004","type":"file","x":985,"y":510,"width":305,"height":170,"file":"tafreegh-skill/references/formatting-rules.md"},
		{"id":"2200000000000005","type":"text","x":650,"y":710,"width":640,"height":170,"color":"6","text":"### Dialogue, `LectureIdentity` & Golden Benchmarks\n- `lecture_identity.py`: `LectureIdentity` resolves 3-line headers, `resolved_stem`, and cross-folder matches.\n- Student turns: `طالب: ` prefix, `13` **Known Cues** (طالب: صوت غير مسموع.), **Echoed Student Turn**, **Attendee Anonymization** -> فلان.\n- `8` Golden Benchmarks in `tafreegh-skill/examples/`: `4` Primary (`example-01..04`) + `4` Fallback (`example-fallback-01..04`)."},
		{"id":"2300000000000001","type":"text","x":1430,"y":50,"width":480,"height":200,"color":"4","text":"### Word Compilation (`export_docx.py` + `Word base.docx`)\n- Compiles Markdown into `Word base.docx` (`0.5\"` margins, `Traditional Arabic` `18pt`, RTL `w:bidi`/`w:rtl`).\n- Restricts bold runs solely to standalone Matn `**(المتن)**`; enforces single-gap Matn paragraphs (ADR 0005).\n- Strips **Markdown Leakage**, NotebookLM headers (`Source guide`, `.mp3`), and تقرير المتن الهجين (ADR 0003)."},
		{"id":"2300000000000002","type":"text","x":1430,"y":280,"width":480,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### `03_AI_Outputs/` & Atomic Archiving\n- Archives `<stem>_AI.md` baseline in flat `03_AI_Outputs/` (never moved — baseline for **Diff Loop**; `.docx` routes to OneDrive).\n- `archive_processed_inputs()` moves only stem-matched raw/matn files into `processed/` and deletes `_مقاطع/` chunks (ADR 0002)."},
		{"id":"2300000000000003","type":"text","x":1430,"y":490,"width":480,"height":150,"color":"4","text":"### OneDrive Course Delivery\n- Routes exported `.docx` directly to:\n  `C:\\Users\\L\\OneDrive\\1. دوري\\<Course>\\<stem>.docx`\n- Supports `--overwrite` for in-place QA remediation."},
		{"id":"2300000000000004","type":"text","x":1430,"y":670,"width":480,"height":210,"color":"4","text":"### Post-Export QA Subagent (`verify_docx.py`)\n- Dispatched after export (`DOCX QA Validator & Fixer`).\n- Checks 3-line header, `Traditional Arabic` `18pt` RTL XML, Matn fidelity vs. raw/source, dialect rules, attendee leaks, canonical *du'a*, and Quranic `*` exceptions (ADR 0007).\n- Repairs `03_AI_Outputs/<stem>_AI.md` & re-exports via `--overwrite` (up to `3` loops) until `Errors: 0` (`PASSED`)."},
		{"id":"2400000000000001","type":"text","x":2050,"y":50,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"2","text":"### Human Review in MS Word -> (تم التسليم)\n- Reviewer edits and finalizes the `.docx` deliverable in Microsoft Word.\n- Moves finished `.docx` into the OneDrive `(تم التسليم)` subfolder inside the course directory."},
		{"id":"2400000000000002","type":"text","x":2050,"y":250,"width":480,"height":190,"color":"2","text":"### Ingestion (`fetch_training_data.py` + `read_docx.py`)\n- Scans OneDrive `(تم التسليم)` for reviewed `.docx` deliverables.\n- `read_docx.py` extracts `word/document.xml`, preserving bold Matn `**(...)**` runs while normalizing text.\n- Locates matching `_AI.md` baseline via `LectureIdentity` and writes ground-truth `.md` to `04_Training_Data/`."},
		{"id":"2400000000000003","type":"text","x":2050,"y":470,"width":480,"height":220,"color":"2","text":"### Diff Analysis (`diff_inline_matn.py` + `diff_cues.py`)\n- `diff_inline_matn.py` classifies edits into: `fallback_correction` (**Fallback Correction**), `oral_citation` (**Oral Citation**), `matn_copy_error`, and `anchor_expiry_reread`.\n- `diff_cues.py` nominates **Known Cue** candidates before user-added طالب: صوت غير مسموع. while suppressing **Rhetorical Suffixes** (ها؟, إيه؟) per ADR 0006."},
		{"id":"2400000000000004","type":"text","x":2050,"y":720,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"### Skill & Benchmark Evolution\n- Feeds verified colloquial spellings into `dialect-rules.md`, formatting rules into `formatting-rules.md`, cues into `SKILL.md`, and golden triples into `tafreegh-skill/examples/`."},
		{"id":"2500000000000001","type":"file","x":40,"y":1090,"width":460,"height":240,"file":"CODING_STANDARDS.md"},
		{"id":"2500000000000002","type":"text","x":540,"y":1090,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"### Repo Guardrail (`scripts/verify_repo.py`)\n- Validates 4 standard folders (`01..04` + `processed/` / `_مقاطع`), `ALLOWED_ROOT_FILES`, and `.scratch/` containment.\n- Checks `course-routing.md` 3-column table parity and `CODING_STANDARDS.md` required sections.\n- Blocks negative phrasing (`never`, `don't`, `ignore`, `prohibited`, لا تفعل, تجنب) and Arabic inside inline backticks in skill docs (ADR 0003)."},
		{"id":"2500000000000003","type":"text","x":1080,"y":1090,"width":520,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"### Pytest Suites (`10`) & Git Tooling Hooks\n- `tests/test_verify_repo.py` (`1` suite, incl. `GLOSSARY.md` domain purity) + `9` skill suites in `tafreegh-skill/tests/` (`test_pipeline_e2e.py`, matcher, export, verify, read, fetch, diffs).\n- Tooling (`package.json`, `pytest.ini`): **Husky** (`.husky/pre-commit`) + **lint-staged** (`.lintstagedrc`) + **Prettier** (`.prettierrc`).\n- `.gitignore`: excludes `03_AI_Outputs/`, `04_Training_Data/`, `.scratch/`, `tafreegh-skill/`, and `.obsidian/`."},
		{"id":"2500000000000004","type":"file","x":1640,"y":1090,"width":440,"height":240,"file":"docs/agents/deferred-reviews.md"},
		{"id":"2500000000000005","type":"text","x":2120,"y":1090,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"### Workspace Hygiene & Junctions\n- `.scratch/` (`$env:TEMP`): governed containment for logs, diffs, and temporary runs (ADR 0001).\n- `.agents/skills/` -> junction to `C:\\Users\\L\\.agents\\skills` (shared global skills like `arabic-word-production` sit outside Tafreegh runtime).\n- `tafreegh-skill/` -> local non-dot junction to `.agents/skills/tafreegh/` for Obsidian resolution."},
		{"id":"2600000000000001","type":"file","x":50,"y":1410,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0001-review-guardrails.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000002","type":"file","x":675,"y":1410,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0002-atomic-archiving-and-hybrid-matn.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000003","type":"file","x":1300,"y":1410,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0003-markdown-leakage-sanitization.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000004","type":"file","x":1925,"y":1410,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0004-numbered-lecture-routing-and-stem-matching.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000005","type":"file","x":50,"y":1610,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0005-lecture-identity-and-dynamic-routing-ssot.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000006","type":"file","x":675,"y":1610,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0006-rhetorical-suffix-cue-suppression.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000007","type":"file","x":1300,"y":1610,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0007-intra-citation-ayah-asterisks.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000008","type":"file","x":1925,"y":1610,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0008-compound-sharh-matn-alignment.md"},
		{"id":"2600000000000009","type":"file","x":50,"y":1810,"width":580,"height":170,"file":"docs/adr/0009-retire-context-md-into-glossary-and-course-routing.md"}
	],
